<view class="page">
  <scb-header title="账号安全与找回"/>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice warning">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!enabled}}" class="notice warning">邮件通道尚未配置，请联系主办方核对账号；当前不能发送验证或找回邮件。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">申请账号操作码</view>
    <view class="field-label">本人注册邮箱</view><input class="field" data-field="email" value="{{email}}" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="254"/>
    <button class="primary" data-kind="reset" bindtap="request" disabled="{{busy || !enabled}}">申请重置密码邮件</button>
    <button wx:if="{{signedIn}}" class="secondary" data-kind="verify" bindtap="request" disabled="{{busy || !enabled || verified}}">{{verified ? '当前邮箱已验证' : '验证当前账号邮箱'}}</button>
    <view class="small muted">新申请会使同用途旧码失效。重置码15分钟有效；验证邮箱码24小时有效。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">使用邮件中的操作码</view>
    <view class="field-label">操作码</view><input class="field" data-field="token" value="{{token}}" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="43"/>
    <view class="field-label">重置密码填写新密码；验证邮箱留空</view><input class="field" data-field="newPassword" value="{{newPassword}}" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" password maxlength="128"/>
    <button wx:if="{{!pending}}" class="primary" bindtap="consume" disabled="{{busy || !enabled}}">确认本次账号操作</button>
    <block wx:else><button class="primary" data-kind="receipt" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">用操作码核对原请求结果</button><button class="secondary" data-kind="cancel" bindtap="resolve" disabled="{{busy}}">明确取消原请求</button></block>
    <view class="small muted">密码和操作码不写入设备恢复记录。关闭页面清除输入；未知结果保留原编号，回来后重新粘贴操作码核对。同一账号新申请的码也可核对或取消原请求。</view>
  </view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="login">返回账号登录</button>
</view>
